{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元本無標題，今為檢尋者，準餘蒙求之例標之。元本蠹滅者，檢本傳補之，為分元本文細書之也。\n元本文字有疑誤者，於各條之終註之。又元本以異本校者，註本文傍。今悉準校訂疑誤，註各條終。\n此書二百一十有四句，用韻三十有二也。今為便檢尋，標於格上。又有叶韻者，於句下註其反切也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中云字當作曰，遇進疑當作過進。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "數軌切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誓疑當作擔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生長，元本中傍註云：一本作人身可也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "笑，本傳作驚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󴃻疑當作恢字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "橤生切，音汝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺明本傳作覺名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "犳音豹，即豹字省也。又音\n勺，獸豹文也。○伴一人者，本傳作三人，傳文疑誤歟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "置於殿上之置字疑寫倒，當作帝命置酒及一蒸羆於殿上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "來於，準本傳，疑當作來游歟？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳州本傳作越州，又三尺餘作二尺三寸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "銑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譏諫，疑當作規諫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "侵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天下振名，疑當作振名天下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "轝音豫，舁土器也。今文恐寫誤，疑當作輦輿之字。又從衡疑當作從衛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十餘丈，本傳作數十丈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "持衷，疑當作折衷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明疑當作智，本傳亦爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姑一驢，疑\n當作茹一驢。或又姑一驢者，姑且之義歟？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "青"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入關中之上，一有再字。減佛法，一作滅佛教。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "質"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山門，傳中作雲門。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上蠹滅纔殘此一百一十九字，今私依殘文并本傳取意私補之云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道超塵埋，　明徹梁絕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道超，姓陸，吳郡之人也。少以勤篤知名。超處獨房，屏絕賓伴，居習學。內外塵埃滿室，蟋蟀鳴壁。中書郎張率謂曰：蟲聲聒耳，塵土埋膝，安能對此而無忤耶？超答：時聞\n虫聲，足代簫管。塵土雖㤃，我未暇掃。其剛學若是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明徹六歲出家學教，立志守操，勤苦知名。與同學數僧住師舊房，其房本朽壞，忽風雨吹屋欹倒，無物支持，數\n僧皆走。徹居其屋，學業如故。或問之：屋崩何不避之耶？徹答曰：寸陰難癈爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法友來未詳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "屑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一千餘人，傳作八百餘人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道常傳作道恒，投身作遁身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昴當作昂也。昴，星名，从日卯。昂者，升也，从日卬也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世施其容，疑當\n作世絕其容。酉陽雜俎載此事云：三尼及坐，含㖒調笑，逸態絕世。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為業下一有時字，若國王上有曰字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七八年，傳作四五年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "易"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉口疑當作唪口，音奉，口之高貌也。或分唪字以為奉口之字歟？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "飜譯集作僧善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偏明，\n疑當作从彳普徧之字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔麻〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉靈當作漢靈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一伴疑當作二伴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乎乃，疑當作手乃。著乃，一本無乃字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "改難，當作攻難。關貴，疑當作問責。道常，傳中作道恒。杼軸，傳中作杼\n柚，音相通。杼音處，機之行緯者也，俗曰梭者也，與軸字相關。若柚字，橘之類，但音同，當以今文為正也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "渡吏，一無渡字也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚮當作響字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殊遇切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一日下有忽字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨枷下一字蠹滅，未知何等字，見文勢或脫字歟？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "馬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空中，傳文作坑中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達下蠹滅，疑却字歟，"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八尺五寸，傳作八尺三寸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虜帥之帥音衰，將也。若音率，是所領兵也。○岱郡當作代郡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳云：曇鸞亦作巒，字無定也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍瑞上一有之字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "屋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至明帝三字，衍文也。沙門，本傳作胡人為正，今文寫誤歟？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鵝傳中作鳶字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同行下一有帝字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見兄，猶言見在兄者也。或見字\n是其字寫誤歟？自爾，傳作因爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢靈下一無帝字。又此是舉其先祖事也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅與大臣當作後秦姚興也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別竟，傳作化竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無後，疑當作無復"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須臾下一有復字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空中傳之文無此字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "數軌切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水深數丈，傳作木深六七尺。愈臰於前，作數日不得至。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二字󴃳滅，疑是死秦二字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鎮下一有于字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T33n1717_p0815a11"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T50n2060_p0686b21-29"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T52n2110_p0510c23"}
